# PP-NSMF S4 test rule: alert on HTTP 401 (Unauthorized) responses.
#
# This is a lab-only detection rule used to exercise the Suricata alert path
# for the S4 authentication-failure scenario. It is not a production rule and
# does not by itself establish detection effectiveness; that requires labelled
# ground truth and false-positive/negative measurement.

alert http any any -> any any (msg:"PP-NSMF auth failure (HTTP 401)"; http.stat_code; content:"401"; classtype:unsuccessful-user; sid:1000001; rev:1;)
